        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;reviews--optimization-theory-review-notes&#34;&gt;Reviews — Optimization Theory Review Notes
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;STATUS&lt;/strong&gt;: Review content is fully integrated as a Hugo content section.
See details below for structure and conventions used.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
